---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import CTAButton from '../components/CTAButton.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Logicmanse Solutions Canada Inc. publishes coloring books, log books, journals, and cookbooks designed to actually get used."
>
  <section class="bg-navy text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-center">
      <h1 class="fade-in-up font-serif font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-4">About Logicmanse Solutions</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 space-y-8">
      <!--
        TODO (Ani): swap for a real photo — you, your workspace, or a
        stack of finished books — whenever you have one. This brand
        visual (mark + wordmark + tagline, per the brand guide PDF) is a
        reasonable stand-in until then.
      -->
      <div class="fade-in-up rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/about/brand-hero.jpg" alt="Logicmanse Solutions" class="w-full h-auto" />
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in-up">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-4">Why Logicmanse Solutions Exists</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Logicmanse Solutions Canada Inc. publishes coloring books, log books, journals, and
          cookbooks built to actually get used — not just displayed. Every title starts from a
          real, specific need: a landlord who needs somewhere to track six properties for a full
          year, a parent looking for a coloring book their kid will actually finish, a home cook
          who wants a cookbook that earns a permanent spot on the counter instead of the shelf.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          We'd rather publish one book that solves a real problem than ten that just reskin the
          same template. If a section doesn't earn its place on the page, it doesn't go in the
          book.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in-up">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-4">How We Work</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Every book starts with real research into what's already out there and what's actually
          missing — not a template with the title swapped out. Most titles also come with a free
          companion digital resource, so a physical book is never the only way to get value from
          it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in-up">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-4">Based in Ontario, Canada</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Logicmanse Solutions Canada Inc. is a registered corporate entity based in Ontario,
          Canada.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-center">
      <SectionHeading title="Have a Question About One of Our Books?" subtitle="Reach out — we usually reply within a business day." />
      <div class="fade-in-up">
        <CTAButton href="/contact/">Get in Touch</CTAButton>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
